Krita Nova 13 - Line tool shortcut only from the painting tools

The Line tool's activation shortcut (V by default, or whatever the user
assigned) switched to the Line tool from any tool, e.g. while selecting,
typing text or moving a layer.

KoToolManager::CanvasData::activateToolActions() enables the tool-switch
actions on every tool change. The "KritaShape/KisToolLine" action is now only
enabled while the active tool is the Freehand Brush, the Eraser (patch 01),
the Multibrush, the Dynamic Brush or
the Line tool itself, so the shortcut does nothing elsewhere. The toolbox
button goes through KoToolAction, not this QAction, and still always works.

